FROM gemma4:12b

# GraphRCA RCA / drill-down configuration.
#
# ROOT CAUSE: gemma4 is a "thinking" model — it reasons for ~3,000-4,000 tokens in
# message.reasoning BEFORE emitting the final JSON answer in message.content. With
# ollama's DEFAULT num_ctx (~2-4K) the ~2-3K-token drill prompt + the reasoning
# exceeded the context window, so the answer was never generated -> EMPTY content
# (the "300 completion tokens / 0 chars" symptom). The OpenAI-compat /v1 endpoint
# does NOT pass options.num_ctx through, so num_ctx must be set here in the model.
#
# Baking a large context window + the model card's recommended sampling directly
# into the model makes every call (via /v1 or /api) allocate enough room.
PARAMETER num_ctx 32768
PARAMETER temperature 1
PARAMETER top_p 0.95
PARAMETER top_k 64
